cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use HOI-Retarget, please cite the paper. If you use the object meshes or
  the source motions, please also cite OMOMO and InterMimic -- they are the rights
  holders for the data this pipeline consumes.
title: "HOI-Retarget: Contact-Centric Retargeting for Human-Object Interaction"
abstract: >-
  A contact-centric method that transfers human-object interaction onto a humanoid
  robot for large-scale motion-data generation. Inverse kinematics maps the human
  pose onto the robot and rescales the object into its reach; a windowed trajectory
  optimization then recovers every labelled contact as a target in the object frame,
  balanced against body tracking, foot support and smoothness under the robot's
  kinematic limits. Because the targets are anchored to the object rather than to
  the original human motion, the same formulation augments a single demonstration
  across object sizes, absorbs contacts reconstructed from monocular video, and
  extends to several robots manipulating one object.
type: software
license: BSD-3-Clause
version: "1.0.0"
repository-code: "https://github.com/shinben0327/hoi-retarget"
url: "https://shinben0327.github.io/hoi-retarget"
